      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const response = $input.first().json;\nconst raw = response.content?.[0]?.text;\nif (!raw || raw.trim().length < 20)\n  throw new Error('Body Claude call returned empty or too short. Response: ' + JSON.stringify(response).substring(0, 200));\n\nconst raw_body_draft = raw.trim();\nconst inp = $('Step 7c - Parse Opening + Build Body Prompt2').first().json;\nconst bv = inp.brand_voice;\n\nconst seo_system_prompt =\n'Role: Final SEO and governance pass for a completed hospitality response. Preserve the draft\\'s human quality; if SEO weakens it, omit SEO.\\n\\n' +\n\n'SEO: seo_keywords include both descriptive terms (business name, dish names) and promotional claims (e.g., \"Best Peruvian Restaurant,\" \"chef-driven dining\"). Descriptive terms can be used freely. Promotional terms only work when the review gives a natural opening — matching what the guest actually said (cuisine praise, an occasion mentioned, a specific dish). When a natural opening exists, prefer a promotional term over a descriptive one, since descriptive terms already appear elsewhere in the response. Integrate keywords only within real sentences in the body — never in the opening line. Never force a promotional term where it reads like an ad — skip it instead.\\n\\n' +\n\n'Governance: Remove or replace email addresses, URLs, placeholders like [contact]/[name]/[email], \"We apologize for any inconvenience\", refund/voucher/discount/financial commitments, and named contact channels such as \"our website\", \"our profile\", or \"our direct messaging\". Keep generic T2/T3 contact invitations such as \"please reach out to us directly\".\\n\\n' +\n\n'Guest Name: If GUEST NAME is available and absent from the draft, insert it only in the opening line. For T1, add \"Hello [Name],\" at the start. For T2/T3, add \"Hello [Name] —\" before the existing opening. Do not rewrite anything else.\\n\\n' +\n\n'Output: Return plain text only. No JSON, preamble, or explanation. If no changes are needed, return the draft exactly as received.';\n\nconst seo_user_prompt =\n`DRAFT TO REVIEW:\\n${raw_body_draft}\\n\\n` +\n`RESPONSE TIER: ${inp.confirmed_response_tier}\\n` +\n`GUEST NAME: ${(inp.reviewer_handle && !inp.reviewer_handle.toLowerCase().includes('review') && !inp.reviewer_handle.toLowerCase().startsWith('anonymous')) ? inp.reviewer_handle : 'Not available'}\\n` +\n`SEO KEYWORDS: ${bv.seo_keywords || 'none specified'}\\n\\n` +\n`Apply all three tasks. Return plain text only.`;\n\nconst seo_prompt_body = JSON.stringify({\n  model: 'claude-sonnet-4-6',\n  max_tokens: 600,\n  temperature: 0,\n  system: seo_system_prompt,\n  messages: [{ role: 'user', content: seo_user_prompt }]\n});\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  bra_record_id:              inp.bra_record_id,\n  confirmed_response_tier:    inp.confirmed_response_tier,\n  governance_flag:            inp.governance_flag,\n  human_review_required:      inp.human_review_required,\n  solution_type:               inp.solution_type,\n  emotional_axis:              inp.emotional_axis,\n  pain_axis:                   inp.pain_axis,\n  stability_axis:              inp.stability_axis,\n  signal_based_consideration:  inp.signal_based_consideration,\n  tone_style:                  inp.tone_style,\n  urgency_level:               inp.urgency_level,\n  commercial_risk_flag:        inp.commercial_risk_flag,\n  behavioral_interpretation:   inp.behavioral_interpretation,\n  lang:                        inp.lang,\n  client_id:                   inp.client_id,\n  enriched_emotion_tag:        inp.enriched_emotion_tag,\n  enriched_pain_point:         inp.enriched_pain_point,\n  pain_point_sub_category:     inp.pain_point_sub_category,\n  signal_type:                 inp.signal_type,\n  intensity_level:             inp.intensity_level,\n  hsi_record_id:               inp.hsi_record_id,\n  ess_record_id:               inp.ess_record_id,\n  eip_record_id:               inp.eip_record_id,\n  ala_record_id:               inp.ala_record_id,\n  prior_run_id:                inp.prior_run_id,\n  reviewer_handle:             inp.reviewer_handle,\n  emotion_hypothesis:          inp.emotion_hypothesis,\n  keywords:                    inp.keywords,\n  brand_voice:                 inp.brand_voice,\n  brand_voice_brief:           inp.brand_voice_brief,\n  signal_enrichment_brief:     inp.signal_enrichment_brief,\n  lang_resolved:               inp.lang_resolved,\n  opening_sentence:            inp.opening_sentence,\n  raw_body_draft:              raw_body_draft,\n  seo_prompt_body:             seo_prompt_body\n} }];"
